<title>HUNGARY: Hungary BUBOR steady for all maturities.</title>
<headline>Hungary BUBOR steady for all maturities.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) remained steady for all one-month, three-month and six-month maturities, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was set at 21.27 percent, three-month rate at 21.14 percent and six-month rate at 21.00 percent, all unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
